BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 14 - Mars: the electric platform (щ.лос), an MPU behind it, the charging station.
The station ahead: a cabinet with a 15 m cable on a reel and a rack of energy cells. The щ.лос faces it 12 m away, the MPU
10 m behind the щ.лос. Both start half empty. Niza Krit in the suit beside them.
LOOK at a thing within arm's reach - its actions show beside the aim; the mouse wheel picks one, F does it.
Mouse: the look (no button); Alt: the cursor (Orbiter's menu, buttons). X puts down what is in the hands, Shift+X throws it,
F at a thing on the ground takes it again (F at a jet pack puts it on).
CHARGING: F at the station - take the cable; walk to a machine's power socket - F plugs it in. CELLS: F at a cell's hatch on
the MPU - out into the hands; F at the station's rack - on charge, or a charged one; F at an empty bay - in.
DRIVING: F climbs on / at the seat; the щ.лос's driver sees its gauges along the bottom of the screen.
END_DESC

